name: sim.readDistance
description: 
luaSynopsis: int result,float smallestDistance=sim.readDistance(int distanceObjectHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. distanceObjectHandle: handle of the distance object
2. smallestDistance: smallest distance (valid only if return value is different from -1)
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. result: 1 if distance was read, and 0 if sim.handleDistance was never called, or if sim.resetDistance was previously called.
2. smallestDistance: the smallest distance. Is nil if result is not 1
